Subject: [PATCH] Fix Pufferfish and Purpur patches

Frontier Paper 26.4 compatibility for experience orbs and shift-click mending, persistent enchanting-table lapis inventories, entity conversion, time packets, and Purpur diagnostics. The 26.4 XP orb merging lifecycle no longer requires the obsolete skip-initial-merge flag. Original Leaf author Dreeam; no runtime/gameplay validation claimed.

